 can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠨᡒᠩᡍᡗᡁᢋᠡᠦᡟᡍᠨᢂᠳᢑᠼᡁᠼᡠᡁᡍᡭᡯᡖᡓᢒᢋᡡᡐᠵᡓᢒᠪᡖᠨᡟᡞᡠᡙᡳᡝᡓᡰᠭ᠐ᡴᢛᢟᡙᢋᡯᢏᢥᢠᠠᠩᡀᢓᢛᠠᡕᢜᢂᢓᠦᡖᡏᡴᡲ᠀ᠿᢀᡒᠦᠵᡙᠳᢋᢡ᠑ᡞᡍᡀᡕ᠀ᠨᡍᢢ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":370.18,"y":253.71,"cell":13189,"i":302,"name":"Khovshigan Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༣༼༊༒༨༃༑༳༨༾༬༻༛༵༫༶༫༌༊༠༉༼༷༴༌༹༼༩༲༓༃༨༮༃༼༾༚༖༛༨༼༉༚༔༳༲༼༷༳༨༳༁༳༳༦༅༌༓༃༢༌༠༐༥༭༢༭༄༙༮༤༷༸༑༭༶༶ༀ༩༽༑</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":990.88,"y":395.24,"cell":34331,"i":303,"name":"Mstis Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc29\udc3f\ud802\ud802𐠷\udc1d\ud802\ud802𐠢 \udc22𐠜\udc24\udc2e\udc26\ud802\ud802𐠡\udc3c\udc1c𐠎\ud802𐠤𐠟\udc35\ud802\ud802𐠯\udc0c\udc01\udc3c𐠏𐠮\udc27\udc29\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1373.51,"y":257.6,"cell":13823,"i":304,"name":"Hofsgauhau Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༥༪༆༡་༿༉༯༶༗༰༵༰༧༻༉༼༼༒༦༰༜༔༈༅༒༑༰༤༙༁༭༐༂༭༳༷༨༛ༀ༩༠༗༙༜༅༕༆༢༪༉༥༳༳༨༮༄༐༗༄༡༬༡༠༗༣༗༅༕་༂༡༥༧༬༻༹༼༆༰ༀ༢༽༫</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1339.7,"y":77.9,"cell":568,"i":305,"name":"Qalleq Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ፐአመሰዘተ ጠነለ የነፀሐገጰቀ ሀነገተረፐኀፐተፀ ደሐዐበጰኀፈለደፀፐከሀከአ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":258.93,"y":1074.52,"cell":101247,"i":306,"name":"Bolis Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> \udc03\ud802𐠫\udc0d\udc2c\udc21\udc31 \udc2a\ud802\ud802𐠲\ud802 𐠲\ud802𐠰\ud802\ud802𐠯𐠡\ud802\ud802𐠠 \ud802𐠗\udc29\ud802𐠙 \udc34𐠅\udc01𐠚\udc13𐠋\udc02\udc1a\ud802𐠮\udc21\udc12\udc26</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":805.69,"y":595.47,"cell":67040,"i":307,"name":"Huitlalneca Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳗ ⳪ ⳖⳂⲸⳔⲲⳖⳃⳔ Ⳁ⳹⳾Ⳝⳃ⳾ⳖⳆⳢⲴⲸⳠⲾⲼⳐⳀ Ⳁ⳾Ⳓ⳪ⲺⳒⳃⳐⳁ⳹Ⳃⳃ⳹Ⳃ⳪ⳤ⳧⳾⳥ⲸⳃⳫⲸⳆⲺ⳧</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":368.68,"y":1029.94,"cell":98598,"i":308,"name":"Ghrailean Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠧᡒᠭᠦᢑᡖᠩᠳᡒᡖᠪᢡᡗᡀᠰ᠐ᡞᢜᠠᠾᡕᠰᡞᡲᠧᢏᡟᠨᡔᡞᡍ᠀ᢡᡍ᠑ᠾᡍᢁᢠᡁᠽᡱᡱᠯᡝᠠᠮᡑᠱᠿᡰᠪᠧᢒᢒᠭᠳᡀ᠐ᠾᡰᡑᡕᡖᡖᡡᢥᠮ᠑ᠿᢂᠻᠡᢢᡔᢢᡠᡜᡞᠯᠵᢀᡀᡖᡕᠲᡲᡁᠱᡎᡍᡖ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":282.55,"y":1111.15,"cell":104027,"i":309,"name":"Solis Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ነሀፈሀሀፈጠዐፐደረሠየወ ነ  ፐገደ ሠፈመከጸነ ሰከሐጰበሰነዘጰፈሀኀሰረወፈተገአሠረፐገፈነአጸየሀመቀቀመረገተሐሀሐጠደገጰተሀፐረጸነለበረሐከመሐመፈከፀ አኀ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1420.25,"y":146.13,"cell":3494,"i":310,"name":"Qaatak Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc14𐠈\udc1a\udc0c\udc1a\udc28\udc14\ud802𐠙\udc1d𐠦\udc19\udc2e\udc1c\ud802𐠩\udc0f𐠢\udc31\ud802𐠫 \udc22\ud802𐠨\udc2e\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠨\udc34𐠮\udc35 \ud802𐠕 \udc13\udc21\ud802𐠖\udc08𐠍𐠂\udc38</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":551.71,"y":367.61,"cell":29003,"i":311,"name":"Nongak Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ፀለነዐ ለየኀጰ  ደፈፈረተሀ ፈሐተነሀሠወፀጠመመከቀዘወበቀየ ጠኀየደ ሰ ሰሐጠ ሰዐፀሐቀፐጰፀከሀኀፐተየመ ገጠከጸከ በጰለ ሀረመቀ ነበረ የ ኀ ተጸ የ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":428.52,"y":172.16,"cell":5864,"i":312,"name":"Hosont Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡀᢛᢑᠰᢡᢥᠰᠧᢤᡠᢑᡓᢏᠦᠩᠾᢓᡀᢡᢞᠯᢁᡆᡭ᠀ᢒᢛᠪᡰᠽᡭᢟᠭᠪᡯᢁᠳᠨᢠᢦᡟᡜᡕᢐᡮᠾᡭᢡᠰᡮᡀᠨᢥᡔᢏᢠᢑ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1612.94,"y":438.59,"cell":43218,"i":313,"name":"Sharant Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༙༂༳༸༵༨ༀ༲༖ༀ༨༒༦༤༸༯༸༱༄༂༪༧༖༙༈༫༖༭༣༹༵༻༭ༀ༵༿༳༚༤༦༁༛༿༤ༀ༸༤༵ༀ༂༪༛༿༌༣༛༥༾༥༚༨༃༕༘༕༌༒༲༯༇༨༥༓༜༈༑༖༴༦༰ༀ༲༼༻༳༑</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":541.56,"y":349.41,"cell":25405,"i":314,"name":"Hwamyeol Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠭᢜᢞᢐᠼᢛᡠᠧᡟᢐᠱᡡᠪᢁᠠᢞᡰ᠀ᡒᢁᡍᡝᠲᠩ᠑ᢡᡭᠮᢒᠼᢜᡑᡴᠡᡁ᠑ᢛᠳᡮᡱᡳᡀᡜᡳᢠᡞᡞᠦᠪᡁᢂᠦᡡᠪᡮᠡᡖᠩᠦᠪᡞᠵᠧᡠᡓᢟᠱᡯᢠᠳᢞ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1523.51,"y":253.59,"cell":13356,"i":315,"name":"Flaksta Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802\ud802𐠁\udc30𐠬\udc37 \udc0e\udc24\udc37\udc3c\udc1c\ud802𐠸\ud802𐠋\udc02𐠊 \udc04\udc2b𐠒\udc35\ud802𐠩\ud802𐠛\ud802\ud802𐠔\udc38\udc2f\udc29\ud802𐠩\udc18\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠒\ud802𐠷\udc32𐠓\udc1a\udc11\udc08\udc34\udc1c\udc0b\udc1e\udc0c𐠼\ud802\ud802𐠈\ud802\ud802𐠁\udc20\ud802𐠂\ud802\ud802𐠎\ud802𐠌\ud802𐠓\ud802𐠌\ud802\ud802 \ud802 \udc31\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1357.01,"y":169.5,"cell":5699,"i":316,"name":"Nuniaat Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༴༯༂༑༰༬༈༶༷༨༓༢༬༮༦༛༳༡༨༚༤༺༱༉༖༰༰༠༒༣༒༢༅༷༖༠༉༧༑༕༜༒༛༔༒༠༶༾༧༻༺༛༿༑༱༂༗༹༧༡༬༫༶༈ༀ༢༑༵༧༸༹་༸༶༽༇༠༶༼༼༡༘༦</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":910.63,"y":640.02,"cell":71678,"i":317,"name":"Pahualococo Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༷༮༆༌་༓༜༑༐༈༃༚་༁༉༓༺༒༚༉༼༼༲༫༤༉༭༣༗༔༑༮༨༔༕༐༚༠ༀༀ༐༈༈༹༸༭༯༃</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":416.93,"y":316.76,"cell":20015,"i":318,"name":"Zejinst Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳤⳘⳐⳄⳂⳞⳜ ⳥ⲶⳬⲲⲺⳫⳭ⳩Ⲹ ⳄⲲⳭⲼⳲⳢⳐⳬ⳧ⳲⲾⳞ⳧ ⳘⳄⳐⳐⲼⳃⲼⲴ⳾ⳜⳒⲼ </div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":446.73,"y":237.56,"cell":11767,"i":319,"name":"Khayan Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">་༹༗༉༅༤༮༙༇༛༉༜༫༱༬༚༽༺ༀ༃༻༭༫༨་༡༊༿༫༿༃༙༦༓༜༩༶༹༆༐༅༜༻༊༜༐༅༓ༀ༉༫༻༧༈༳༮༴༮</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1381.2,"y":250.87,"cell":13070,"i":320,"name":"Hafjorme Statue","note":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc24\udc26\udc37\ud802𐠲\ud802\ud802𐠄\udc0b\udc26𐠱\ud802𐠩\udc14\udc10\ud802\ud802𐠃𐠩\udc02𐠋\udc0e\udc26𐠐\udc02\ud802\ud802𐠬\udc1e 𐠅𐠯\udc2b\udc26\udc20𐠔𐠨\udc17𐠐\udc35\udc2c𐠪𐠳\udc08 \udc18\udc0d\ud802𐠎𐠩𐠷\udc29𐠮\udc34𐠂\udc34\udc05\udc08\udc0b\ud802𐠬\udc11\ud802  </div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1732.45,"y":467.34,"cell":48761,"i":321,"name":"Lintur Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802 \ud802𐠪𐠑𐠷\udc1c\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠩\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠵\udc22\ud802𐠘\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠕𐠍\ud802𐠄\ud802 \udc3f\ud802𐠳\udc33\ud802\ud802𐠃\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc2e\udc2a\ud802𐠌\udc2d𐠧\udc3c \udc13\ud802𐠟\udc0c\udc03\ud802\ud802 \udc08\ud802𐠫</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1349.27,"y":987.63,"cell":95524,"i":322,"name":"Kaohueaa Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc38 𐠲\ud802\ud802𐠈 \udc3c\udc08\udc19\ud802𐠨𐠡\udc0e\ud802\ud802𐠲𐠛\udc32\ud802\ud802𐠠\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠬\ud802𐠜𐠐\udc32\ud802𐠞\udc27\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠼\udc31\udc16\udc08\udc16\udc33\udc1a\udc2d\ud802\ud802 𐠁\ud802𐠮𐠯\udc3c\udc2e\udc16\udc0d\ud802\ud802𐠑\udc19\udc20\ud802𐠼𐠨𐠲\udc26 𐠵\udc15\udc33\udc12 𐠑\udc28</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":373.26,"y":204.82,"cell":9127,"i":323,"name":"Sumnogorde Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802\ud802𐠔\ud802\ud802𐠗𐠰\udc2e𐠂𐠌\ud802𐠂\udc13\udc05\udc0b\udc22\ud802\ud802𐠥𐠼𐠒\udc01\udc03𐠩 \udc25\udc34\udc2f𐠕\udc17\udc1f𐠢\udc38\udc22𐠄\udc24\udc1d\udc23𐠧\ud802𐠼\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc31\udc3f\ud802𐠦\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠼 \udc21\udc31 𐠕\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":456.45,"y":200.82,"cell":8649,"i":324,"name":"Gurvandalsan Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳝ⳥ Ⲷ⳧ⳤⳞⲶⳘⲴⳊⳁⳚⳊⳠ Ⳝ ⳜⳭ⳹Ⲳ⳧ⳠⳄⲼⲼⳆⳁⳢⳒⳎ ⳃⳘⳫⳜ⳾ⲺⲾⳘⳐⲶⲺⲺⲸⳜⳞⳔ⳥ⲾⳎ  ⳀⳊⲾⲴⳤⳈⳐ⳧ⲲⳞⳌⳎⳎⳈⳔⳂⳐ⳥ⲾⳘⳢⲴⳠⳬ⳧ⲺⳚ⳾ⳈⳠⳠ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":753.91,"y":492.98,"cell":52536,"i":325,"name":"Milborlow Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡓᠲᢥᡴᢓᢓᠽᢦᠵᠪᢏᡔ᠑ᠩᢟᡀᡡᠩᠡᢀᡞᢓᠪᢟᡞᢀᡐᡞᠱᡯᢒᡞᡖᠨᠠᠪᠪᠳᡜᠦᠡᠯᠻᢢᡜᠾᠧᠨᢀᠳᠽᢥᡁᡠᢦᢏᠾᢥᡴ᠑ᡠᡖᡲᢒᡳᢦᠠᢒᢐᠿᡴᡒᢐᠼ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":539.46,"y":245.78,"cell":12537,"i":326,"name":"Gaunseong Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⲻ⳹ⲸⲶⳔⳲ ⳆⳂⲼ ⳐⲼⳤⳊ⳧⳥ⳐⳒⳂ ⳘⳲⳁⳈⲼ Ⳃ ⳧⳥ⳫⳁⳎⳆⳂⳘⳠ⳩ Ⳅ⳾ⳫⳞ⳥Ⲷ⳧ⳠⳤⳲⲼⲶⳄⳈ⳧ⳄⳆⳔⳈⳜⳤⳃⳘ ⳪ⳁⳈ⳾Ⲳ ⳾Ⲵⳬ⳩ⳁⳠⳚⳫⳁⲼⳄⲸⳖⲼⲴⲶⳫⳌⲴ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":400.72,"y":989.28,"cell":95642,"i":327,"name":"Innertei Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802𐠯\ud802𐠬\udc0f𐠼\udc32\udc28\udc14\udc0a\udc23\udc31𐠓\ud802 \udc05\udc13\udc30\udc04\udc0e𐠭 \udc04\udc16\udc0c𐠭𐠎\udc11\udc08\ud802𐠗\udc38𐠪\udc19\udc02\udc2e𐠬\udc2a𐠚𐠍\udc02𐠏\udc24\udc10\ud802\ud802𐠖\udc1c𐠬\ud802𐠲\udc38𐠱\udc3f\udc0f𐠖\udc02\udc2d\ud802𐠒\udc2a𐠡\udc01𐠠\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":240.1,"y":979.07,"cell":94555,"i":328,"name":"Kabermaw Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠦᠿᡞᡖᠳᡙᡆᡕᢛ᠐ᠨᢐᢛᡐᠭᠧᢤᡭᢡᡭᠠᠨᡍ᠒ᠰᡙᡰᡎᠽᡕᠨᢤᢛᡝᡗᡎᡯᡞᢞᢦᡱ᠒ᡳ᠑ᠧᡎᡀᢑᡆᡱᡁᡳᡀᢦᠾᢟᡴᢤᡱ᠀ᠰᢁᡍᡝᠻᠪᢥᢛᢢᡓᠾᠧᡝᢟᢋᢂᡖᢜᡰᡔᠾᢜ᠀ᡞᡳᠪᢑ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":849.87,"y":507.95,"cell":55246,"i":329,"name":"Nosmouth Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ለበሀበመነመለወጸዐፐ ኀከኀሰሐአ  ፐከ በሰጠሠተሐኀ ወሠ ተዐ ነረመየሀኀሠፀመሀ ሰሠሰመረ ከኀሰአደጸሀሐመ የነከ ፐከተጠተቀነሐደ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1454.19,"y":423.18,"cell":39958,"i":330,"name":"Nenau Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳔⲼⲸⳂⲴⲺⲺ⳪ⲴⳫ⳪ⳒⳲⳄⳢⲲⲺⲾⳫⳈⳬⳊⳂⳔⳐⳁⳔⳈ⳩⳹ⳎⳖⳀⳎ ⲺⳔ⳪ⳆⳲⳘⳫⲲⳲⳁⳬⲴ⳥⳹ⳬ ⳚⳚⳊ Ⳙ⳥Ⳋ⳹ⳫⳠⳢⳆⳐⳘ ⳞⳃⳫⳆⳞⳞⳬⳊ⳹ Ⳁ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1284.99,"y":126.22,"cell":2053,"i":331,"name":"Graah Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༓༥༛༙༐༑༆༐༛༇༲༵༨༵༛༯༧༛༉༒༔༼༬༛༚༼༜༂༨༇༓༑༯༘༡༵༯༣༈༬༰༩༽༁༔༳༗༯༘</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1352.46,"y":909.82,"cell":87831,"i":332,"name":"Mawea Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡱᢏᢑᡟᠳᡕᡲᠮᠨᠳᡑᢒᡰᡙᢞᡰᠦᠡ᠒ᠳᢟᠠᡙᢟᡀ᠐ᢥᠿ᠐ᠨᢏᡱᠰᢑᢋᡞᢂᢞᠮᡓᢦᢜᡙᠿᡎᡯᠻᡱᢜᡭᠽᡕᠧᢥᠨᠮᢤᡗᢡᢒᡞᠿᡒᠻᢓᠮᡏ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1559.31,"y":422.34,"cell":39997,"i":333,"name":"Celd'rauial Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢁᠯᢀᡠᢋᡜᡕᡏᡞ᠑ᠼᡭᠨᠰ᠀ᡓᠠᠽ᠒ᡒᡲᢟᡞᡗᡳᢟᡯᠿᡭᡳᢋᠡᠿᢥᡮᢟ᠀ᡞᡙᡔᠱᠮᡐᡱᡁᠦᠨᡡᠾᠳᡔᡠᡗ᠐ᠩᠭᢛᠽᠭᠳᠼ᠀</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":879.45,"y":515.79,"cell":56475,"i":334,"name":"Warghambe Statue","note":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠳᡟᠧᡰᠲᢓ᠀ᢐᢑᡴᠪ᠐ᠦᠠᢀᡰᡎᢒᠮᡍᡳᡰᠱ᠒ᡆᢑᠪᡁᡮᢁᡭᡭᠪᡁᡐᡲᡙᡝᡖᢡᡮ᠒ᡐᡎ᠒</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1169.66,"y":462.56,"cell":47581,"i":335,"name":"Orbogliano Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༃༗༾༳༓༵༔་༧༫༁༺༠༔༕༕༃༡༔༃༭༗༅༉༷༢༚༪༵༃༃༐༦༌༨༼༃༘༿༔༑༥༡༲༭༩༑༺༸༵༂༖༈༜༬༥༠༙༈༊༙༴༻༇༮༦༧༖༈༉༛༅༊༇༜༊༁༆༨༩༄༑༈༒༻༈༌༘༑༌༐༲༛༙</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1428.27,"y":464.69,"cell":48158,"i":336,"name":"Eitiler Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠮᡀᢋᢛᢒᠰᡲᡱᡑᡟᢛᡠᢤᢠᢜᡆᡗᠼ᠀ᠦᠧᠲᢞᡙᡖᡲᢏᠯᡗᡎᠨᡍᡴᡱᢞᡁᠠᡞᡲᡑᢥᢋᢋᢞᢜᡙᢁᡠᡆᠵᢁᠡᡲᡔᡲᠩᡴᡖᡍ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":277.57,"y":556.5,"cell":62065,"i":337,"name":"Shaming Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠽᠡᠩᢠᠾ᠐ᡆᡐᠮᢦᢂᢤᢁ᠐ᠽᢂᢐᠦᢏᠼᢠᢥᢏᡯᡏᡒᠧᡙᡖᢞᢋᠯᠻᠾᡟᡀᡎᡒᠦᢠᠮᢡᡙᡭᡠ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1521.01,"y":453.71,"cell":46221,"i":338,"name":"Menntyrmel Statue","note":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc19\udc1b\udc21𐠯\udc1d\ud802𐠸\udc2b\udc25𐠫\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠰\ud802𐠅\ud802𐠐𐠁\udc10\udc08\udc19\ud802\ud802𐠿\ud802𐠸\udc37 𐠟𐠡\udc02𐠏 𐠒\ud802𐠠\udc38\udc35 \udc29\udc1d\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠜𐠈\udc12\udc08\udc29\udc28𐠊𐠠\udc34𐠦𐠌\udc38\udc08\ud802𐠌𐠲𐠘\ud802 \udc3c\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc1d\udc08\ud802 \ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":213.92,"y":973.67,"cell":93986,"i":339,"name":"Cao Lay Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡁᡒᢀᠭᡳᠡᢐᠾᡡᡒᠽᠼᡑᡔᡠᢓᡀᠩᡗᢋᢒᡞᠯᢥᡔᢓᢛᠮᢟᢜᠭᢏᡗᢟᡡᢀᢂᡕᠡᡰᠱᡠᡍᠩᠭᡱᢠᡓᡎᡍᢜᢓᢓᡗᢐᡯᡞᠱᢡᠼᠮᠳᡖᡕᡞᡞᠭᡝᢒᡒᠡᡡᡱᡜᢜᠼᢦᡮ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":335.9,"y":660.1,"cell":73301,"i":340,"name":"Tatong Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢜᠩᠾᠱᡔᠾᡑᡰᡴᢥᡑᠻᡱᢞᡒᠿᡓᢢᢞᢀᠪᡒᢤ᠑ᡙᡱ᠒ᡠᢟᢢᢀᠨᢥᡰᢤᡆᡭᠵᡏᡟᡯᡀᠪᠭᡏᡯᠭᡎᡭ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1597.44,"y":228.04,"cell":11243,"i":341,"name":"Ulukkhel Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">་༈༿༸༖༕༧༁༷༈༉༌༮༿ༀ༐༹༪༔༧༐༧་༨༵༛༪༆༯༓༓༮༭༰༼༙༷༌ༀ༊༰༕༢༄༆༕༒༧༁༣༥༷༵༗༉༧༹༺༰༈༑ༀ༑༢༓༡༨༇༗༮༜༡༮༂༤༸་</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":217.44,"y":664.22,"cell":73738,"i":342,"name":"Huzhoujing Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳞⳫⲺⳢⳈⳊ Ⳡ  ⳭⳐⳂⳚⳭⳄⲲⳁ Ⳙ ⳌⲸⲼⳀⳂ⳩⳪ⲲⳁⳜ ⳊⳘ ⲺⳞⳁⲾⳃⲺ⳩ ⳤⳤⳐ⳪Ⳃ⳩⳩ⲴⳒⲶⳀⳁ ⳹ⳒⳆⳞⳜ⳪Ⳮ⳹ⳃ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":396.1,"y":284.62,"cell":16590,"i":343,"name":"Deltant Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802𐠦\udc11\udc2a\udc37\udc18\udc38𐠡\udc0c𐠘\udc0c𐠧\udc21\udc38\udc15\udc0e\udc03\udc1f\udc29\ud802\ud802𐠩\ud802𐠓\udc1d\ud802\ud802𐠔\udc0d𐠊\udc26\udc29\udc02\udc2f𐠑\ud802\ud802𐠘\ud802𐠛𐠋\udc23𐠍\udc0a\udc3c\udc2b\udc1b𐠟\udc02\udc24\udc2a\udc26𐠰 \udc13𐠮\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠪\udc08\ud802\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":118.68,"y":545.11,"cell":60556,"i":344,"name":"Xiliang Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳢⳎ⳧Ⳮ⳾⳹⳹⳩ⳫⳃⳭ⳥⳧Ⲳ ⲲⲴⳞⳆⲲⲼⳢⳢⳬⳐⳔ⳾ⲺⲴ ⳄⳂⳐ⳪ⳆⲶ Ⳁ⳹ ⳄⳘ ⳊⳖⳌⳊⳊⳆⲾⲼⳊⳬ⳹⳩⳾⳪Ⲳ⳧ⳫⳭⳔ ⳎⳤⳔ⳪⳹ⳀⳚⳆⳄⳬⳌⳃ⳥ Ⳙ⳪ⳐⲲ⳥ⳞⳊⳌⳁⲸⳔⳫⲺ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":205.84,"y":704.19,"cell":76283,"i":345,"name":"Shaozhou Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༿༇༔༰༓༓༄༕༮༑༛༨༉༦་༊༐༹༧༑༑༱༘༭༧༳༹༌༑༬༢༄༶་༪༳༩༐༆༱༮་༛༥༮༓༥༽༱༢༐༿༉༲༰༵༿༗༬༤༰༼༦༑༽༵༕༰༿༽༐༌༧༠༣༷ༀ༷༮༥༶</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":833.29,"y":664.37,"cell":73836,"i":346,"name":"Xalpucalapul Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠦\ud802𐠌\udc22\udc12\ud802𐠲\ud802\ud802 \ud802 \udc0b\udc30\udc37𐠙\udc05\ud802𐠲\udc3f𐠔\udc21\udc32\ud802\ud802𐠲\udc3c\ud802𐠘\udc03\udc37\udc13𐠖\ud802𐠕\udc12\udc02\ud802𐠧\udc10\udc0c\ud802𐠢\udc25\udc3f\udc2c\udc21\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠄\udc22\ud802\ud802𐠛\udc1a\udc3c𐠭\udc27 \ud802\ud802 \udc1a𐠪𐠰\udc0b\udc16𐠿\udc20\ud802𐠣\ud802𐠋</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":240.24,"y":428.27,"cell":40676,"i":347,"name":"Kami Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ደዐሠጰለሰሰመሠገነደረከነሰ ጸለሀአጰዘፀቀሐሀከተ ጰሐበጰደዘወሐሐጸወዘዘመለመየመ መገመኀሠደፀዐነከለ የጸ የጸለፐአተ  ተጠጰአመጸ </div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":485.23,"y":260.74,"cell":13990,"i":348,"name":"Hamcheong Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡀᠩᠿᡜᠵᠰᡟᢠᡴᡯᠡᢜᢀᠳᢁᢢᡟᠧᡐᠼᢂᢞᠧᡖᠡᢢᡠᠻᠵᠨᢤᠠᡜᢥᡯᡝ᠐ᢡᠻᡔᡖᡞᡞᡱᢛᡙᢑᡐᡙ᠀ᠩᡕᡎᠱᡀᢏᢢᡜᡒᠮᡖᡓᡳᢂ᠀ᡞᡎᠼ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":874.88,"y":322.99,"cell":20884,"i":349,"name":"Saringmone Statue","note":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡲᠮᢓᠡᠮᢁᠡᢞᢠᠪᡑᡖᠾᡎᡏᡓ᠒ᢠᢡᠭᢠᢟᡭᠩᢥᢦᠼᠠᢐᡏᢟᠡᢥᠪᠠᡔᠠᡖᢑᢟᡴᢏᡐᡟᢥ᠐ᠧᢋᢡᡯᠱᢐᢋᢦᢐ᠐ᡓᢋᡴᠦᢥ᠒ᠯᡑᠼ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1348.33,"y":545.34,"cell":60777,"i":350,"name":"Schoberdorf Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༊༛༫༒༒༕༤༵༩༇༄༖༽༗༔༆༴༺༮༉༗༪༅༷༧༺༗༂༒༖༱༯༤༃༼༾༹༧༉༻༴༙༚༲༿༙༆༈༙༇༤༫༯༪༛༦༥༊༡༾༓༦༸༵༌༣༚༑༴༥ༀ༕༪༦༕༢</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1588.25,"y":406.64,"cell":36690,"i":351,"name":"Chaghe Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡙᡡᠩᡟᢢᠨᡆᢥᡡᡀᡆᠻᡲᢟᡕᡱᡝᢟᡡᠱᢡ᠐᠀ᠧᡰᠿᢋᠿᡙᡝᠯᠧᡏᠼᠼᢋᢡᢛᡓᢛᡑᢞᡭᢛᡍᡁ᠀ᠪᢐᠩᠩᢑᠾᡐᡠᢁᡞᠲᡜᡭᡝᡴᢞᡀᢞᠼᠾᠯᢐᡙᢡᡮᢁᡐᡞᡀ᠒ᢛᡐᡴᡭᢐᡱᠭᡔᠻᠳᠧᡙᡜᢜ᠒ᠳᢒᡲ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1523.37,"y":425.67,"cell":40540,"i":352,"name":"Cyridh Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">በዘቀዘሠመጰ ዐመሰተዘደወሀ ለፐበነገገኀረነገተሀፀኀከፈጠሀ ኀለዘደ ደለ ወፈፐሰዐአሀረሀሀደአለሀደሠፈጸቀጸሰሠፀዐ  የጠ የፀፐአሠ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":281.95,"y":1161.48,"cell":107307,"i":353,"name":"Achartesmos Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802 \udc33\ud802𐠄𐠿\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc3f𐠭\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠙\udc25\udc28 \ud802𐠋\ud802𐠍𐠔\udc34𐠞\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠌\udc27\udc01\udc3c\udc0f\udc35\udc1e𐠳\ud802𐠮\ud802𐠏\udc2a\udc02\udc2a\udc2f𐠿𐠬𐠨\udc3f𐠰\ud802𐠠𐠦\udc35\udc14\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠃\udc18\ud802 𐠛𐠝\udc2f</div>"}