l":83007,"i":468,"name":"Glegisiori Cavern","note":"The Glegisiori Cavern. Locals claim that it is totally empty."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":1418.47,"y":538.98,"cell":60089,"i":469,"name":"Trilerkengen Cave","note":"The Trilerkengen Cave. Locals claim that it is endlessly deep and unexplored."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":378.74,"y":796.96,"cell":78847,"i":470,"name":"Rofors Chasm","note":"The Rofors Chasm. Locals claim that it is a good spot to hid treasure."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":1344.79,"y":491.82,"cell":52714,"i":471,"name":"Frohntermers Cave","note":"The Frohntermers Cave. Locals claim that it is a good spot to hid treasure."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":1644.65,"y":412.18,"cell":37825,"i":472,"name":"Guallatharasp Cave","note":"The Guallatharasp Cave. Locals claim that it is totally empty."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":513.1,"y":1044.1,"cell":99521,"i":473,"name":"Chinchodi Cavern","note":"The Chinchodi Cavern. Locals claim that it is the home of strange monsters."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1280.66,"y":144.09,"cell":3194,"i":474,"name":"Blamiut Cemetery","note":"An eerie necropolis where nature intertwines with death. Overgrown tombstones are entwined by thorny vines, and mournful spirits wander among the fading petals of once-vibrant flowers."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1469.44,"y":255.18,"cell":13588,"i":475,"name":"Feverfi Necropolis","note":"A desolate necropolis where an eerie stillness reigns. Time seems frozen amidst the decaying mausoleums, and the silence is broken only by the whispers of the wind and the rustle of tattered banners."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1601.06,"y":499.19,"cell":54152,"i":476,"name":"Tyuether Necropolis","note":"A sprawling necropolis built within a labyrinthine network of catacombs. Its halls are lined with countless alcoves, each housing the remains of the departed, while the distant sound of rattling bones fills the air."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":572.64,"y":205.49,"cell":9202,"i":477,"name":"Ocheongjin Crypt","note":"A foreboding necropolis perched atop a jagged cliff, overlooking a desolate wasteland. Its towering walls harbor restless spirits, and the imposing gates bear the marks of countless battles and ancient curses."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1406.69,"y":312.55,"cell":19559,"i":478,"name":"Schomers Necropolis","note":"This cursed necropolis is veiled in perpetual twilight, perpetuating a sense of impending doom. Dark enchantments shroud the tombs, and the moans of anguished souls resound through its crumbling halls."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1364.4,"y":156.98,"cell":4444,"i":479,"name":"Serlit Necropolis","note":"A towering necropolis adorned with macabre sculptures and guarded by formidable undead sentinels. Its ancient halls house the remains of fallen heroes, entombed alongside their cherished relics."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1512.08,"y":311.33,"cell":19599,"i":480,"name":"Felheika Tomb","note":"A foreboding necropolis perched atop a jagged cliff, overlooking a desolate wasteland. Its towering walls harbor restless spirits, and the imposing gates bear the marks of countless battles and ancient curses."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1610,"y":472.92,"cell":49684,"i":481,"name":"Cyuetheas Cemetery","note":"This ethereal necropolis seems suspended between the realms of the living and the dead. Wisps of mist dance around the tombstones, while haunting melodies linger in the air, commemorating the departed."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1303.8,"y":183.67,"cell":6988,"i":482,"name":"Naaregoertugaat Sepulchre","note":"A desolate necropolis where an eerie stillness reigns. Time seems frozen amidst the decaying mausoleums, and the silence is broken only by the whispers of the wind and the rustle of tattered banner